          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Revolutionizing Wireless Audio with Auracast Technology</h4><p>At Nightwooolf, we are at the forefront of the <strong>Auracast Bluetooth LE Audio revolution</strong>. Our mission is to bring next-generation wireless audio solutions to everyone - from seniors who need clearer TV audio to families who want to share music together.</p><p>Auracast broadcast audio is a groundbreaking Bluetooth capability that allows unlimited devices to receive high-quality audio from a single transmitter. Unlike traditional Bluetooth which only connects one-to-one, Auracast enables one-to-many broadcasting, transforming how we experience wireless audio.</p><h4>Why Auracast Changes Everything</h4><p>The <strong>LC3 codec</strong> at the heart of Auracast delivers superior audio quality with ultra-low latency. This means perfect lip-sync when watching TV, crystal-clear dialogue for those with hearing difficulties, and the ability for multiple family members to listen at their own preferred volume levels simultaneously.</p>"
